A%A9%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%A4%E5%85%B6%E6%98%AF%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%81%AB%E4%BC%A4%E7%A0%B4%E7%9B%BE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B0%E5%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%83%E4%B8%BA%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1631252229623\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/b4f99d282c41575c4a8564eeacdc746f_6127028070817150231.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">樱火轮舞曾经的毕业武器。被动和主动均可提高绯樱标记的附加频率，但由于樱火轮舞输出依赖的爆发状态，已经提升了附加标记的频率。标记频率的有限阈值导致樱花的誓约并不能显著提升樱火轮舞的输出。超限后显著提升樱火轮舞的输出能力和回sp速度，也能用作提供火焰易伤的辅助装备，尤其是需要火伤破盾的冰律，较为推荐。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/b4f99d282c41575c4a8564eeacdc746f_6127028070817150231.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
